From e9ab1e320e8cd1ed8d43fff1a355590678d5ea1b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
by: triplecN
Subject: [PATCH 07/20] PER fee reservoir

Half of every fee goes into a 28-day reservoir paid to entropy tickets.
Tickets are RandomX proofs at 1/16 of the block target, relayed with the
perticket message and committed in the coinbase.
