+/**
+ * CacheCoin PER (Protracted Entropy Reservoir).
+ *
+ * Fees are split, not burned: the miner of a block claims the subsidy plus
+ * fees - fees/2; the other half enters the current epoch reservoir.
+ * An entropy ticket is a RandomX proof of work over (anchor, payout, nonce)
+ * at nPerTicketTargetMultiplier x the anchor block target. Up to
+ * nPerMaxBlockTickets tickets whose anchor is one of the last
